          "title": "You'll want to know: o sismo",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "o sismo — \"the quake (formal)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "O sismo foi sentido em todo o país. The quake was felt all over the country."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A news word in Portugal."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "sismo was borrowed from Greek seismós \"a shaking, an earthquake\" (EtymDB), from seíein \"to shake\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
